Using Convex SDK 1.44.0, `defineTable` and `v` are imported from `convex/server` and `convex/values` respectively. The following fields are fixed.

```ts
const enrollments = defineTable({
  studentId: v.id("students"), courseId: v.id("courses"),
  enrollmentDate: v.number(), grade: v.optional(v.string()),
});
```

The two queries start their ranges with `q.eq("studentId", studentId)` on `"by_student"` and `q.eq("courseId", courseId)` on `"by_course"`.
